      "writtenOn": "2024-09-19T01:37:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it would be good to extend this size logic to vertex buffers and uniform buffers, but it makes sense to do it one at a time to track performance effects more easily.\n\nOnce we get there, it might not be so necessary to have separate minimum sizes per type, which would clean up some of these constants and the amount of configuration for each `BufferInfo`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "935923560f4726d887b6ec356dd2403d859e778d",
